---
// Post 20 (Alpha) figure: mcts. Inline SVG, site tokens only. Numbers come from the Python runs recorded in the post brief.
---
<figure class="atp20-mcts">
  <div class="atp20-mcts-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 372" role="img" aria-label="Four panels of a small tree: select a path by UCT score, expand one new child, simulate randomly to the end, and back up the result along the path. A formula shows the UCT score with three worked numbers.">
<text x="20" y="28" class="h"><tspan data-lang-en>Monte Carlo tree search, one round in four steps</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Monte Carlo tree search, một vòng gồm bốn bước</tspan></text>
<rect x="20" y="44" width="205" height="214" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="32" y="66" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>1 Select</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1 Chọn</tspan></text>
<line x1="122" y1="92" x2="80" y2="140" class="goldl" />
<line x1="122" y1="92" x2="164" y2="140" class="ln" />
<line x1="80" y1="140" x2="56" y2="190" class="ln" />
<line x1="80" y1="140" x2="104" y2="190" class="goldl" />
<line x1="164" y1="140" x2="188" y2="190" class="ln" />
<circle cx="122" cy="92" r="11" class="nodeg" />
<circle cx="80" cy="140" r="11" class="nodeg" />
<circle cx="164" cy="140" r="11" class="node" />
<circle cx="56" cy="190" r="11" class="node" />
<circle cx="104" cy="190" r="11" class="nodeg" />
<circle cx="188" cy="190" r="11" class="node" />
<text x="32" y="280" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Walk down by the highest</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đi xuống theo điểm UCT</tspan></text>
<text x="32" y="298" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>UCT score at each node.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>cao nhất ở mỗi nút.</tspan></text>
<rect x="245" y="44" width="205" height="214" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="257" y="66" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>2 Expand</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2 Mở rộng</tspan></text>
<line x1="347" y1="92" x2="305" y2="140" class="goldl" />
<line x1="347" y1="92" x2="389" y2="140" class="ln" />
<line x1="305" y1="140" x2="281" y2="190" class="ln" />
<line x1="305" y1="140" x2="329" y2="190" class="goldl" />
<line x1="389" y1="140" x2="413" y2="190" class="ln" />
<circle cx="347" cy="92" r="11" class="nodeg" />
<circle cx="305" cy="140" r="11" class="nodeg" />
<circle cx="389" cy="140" r="11" class="node" />
<circle cx="281" cy="190" r="11" class="node" />
<circle cx="329" cy="190" r="11" class="nodeg" />
<circle cx="413" cy="190" r="11" class="node" />
<line x1="329" y1="190" x2="329" y2="228" class="goldl" />
<circle cx="329" cy="228" r="11" class="nodeg" stroke-dasharray="3 2" />
<text x="257" y="280" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Add one new child under</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Thêm một nút con dưới nút</tspan></text>
<text x="257" y="298" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>the node where you stopped.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>mà bạn dừng lại.</tspan></text>
<rect x="470" y="44" width="205" height="214" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="482" y="66" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>3 Simulate</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>3 Mô phỏng</tspan></text>
<line x1="572" y1="92" x2="530" y2="140" class="ln" />
<line x1="572" y1="92" x2="614" y2="140" class="ln" />
<line x1="530" y1="140" x2="506" y2="190" class="ln" />
<line x1="530" y1="140" x2="554" y2="190" class="ln" />
<line x1="614" y1="140" x2="638" y2="190" class="ln" />
<circle cx="572" cy="92" r="11" class="node" />
<circle cx="530" cy="140" r="11" class="node" />
<circle cx="614" cy="140" r="11" class="node" />
<circle cx="506" cy="190" r="11" class="node" />
<circle cx="554" cy="190" r="11" class="node" />
<circle cx="638" cy="190" r="11" class="node" />
<line x1="554" y1="190" x2="554" y2="214" class="goldl" />
<circle cx="554" cy="214" r="11" class="nodeg" />
<path d="M 554 225 L 542 233 L 564 241 L 548 249 L 560 255" class="mutl" />
<text x="578" y="250" class="xs"><tspan data-lang-en>result</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>kết quả</tspan></text>
<text x="482" y="280" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Finish the formula or game</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Hoàn thành công thức hay ván cờ</tspan></text>
<text x="482" y="298" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>with random choices.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>bằng lựa chọn ngẫu nhiên.</tspan></text>
<rect x="695" y="44" width="205" height="214" rx="8" class="box" />
<text x="707" y="66" class="b"><tspan data-lang-en>4 Back up</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>4 Cập nhật ngược</tspan></text>
<line x1="797" y1="92" x2="755" y2="140" class="goldl" />
<line x1="797" y1="92" x2="839" y2="140" class="ln" />
<line x1="755" y1="140" x2="731" y2="190" class="ln" />
<line x1="755" y1="140" x2="779" y2="190" class="goldl" />
<line x1="839" y1="140" x2="863" y2="190" class="ln" />
<circle cx="797" cy="92" r="11" class="nodeg" />
<circle cx="755" cy="140" r="11" class="nodeg" />
<circle cx="839" cy="140" r="11" class="node" />
<circle cx="731" cy="190" r="11" class="node" />
<circle cx="779" cy="190" r="11" class="nodeg" />
<circle cx="863" cy="190" r="11" class="node" />
<text x="761" y="96" class="goldt">+1</text>
<text x="719" y="144" class="goldt">+1</text>
<text x="793" y="194" class="goldt">+1</text>
<text x="707" y="280" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Send the result back up</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Đưa kết quả ngược lên theo</tspan></text>
<text x="707" y="298" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>the path; update the counts.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>đường đi; cập nhật số đếm.</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="330" class="mono"><tspan data-lang-en>UCT = mean + c × √(ln N / n)   (N = parent visits, n = child visits, c = √2)</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>UCT = trung bình + c × √(ln N / n)   (N = lượt thăm của nút cha, n = của nút con, c = √2)</tspan></text>
<text x="20" y="352" class="s"><tspan data-lang-en>Parent visited 16 times: a child with mean 0.4 after 10 visits scores 1.14; mean 0.6 after 5 visits, 1.65; mean 0 after 1 visit, 2.35.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Nút cha được thăm 16 lần: con có trung bình 0,4 sau 10 lượt được 1,14; trung bình 0,6 sau 5 lượt được 1,65; trung bình 0 sau 1 lượt được 2,35.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The search spends its tries where the score is high or the node is barely explored. For alpha, a node is a half-written formula and the result is its score on history.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Việc tìm kiếm dồn lượt thử vào chỗ điểm cao hoặc nút còn ít được thăm. Với alpha, một nút là công thức viết dở và kết quả là điểm của nó trên dữ liệu quá khứ.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .atp20-mcts { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .atp20-mcts-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .atp20-mcts svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 700px; height: auto; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .atp20-mcts text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .atp20-mcts .h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp20-mcts .s { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp20-mcts .xs { font-size: 12px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp20-mcts .b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp20-mcts .mono { font-family: var(--font-mono, ui-monospace, monospace); font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text); }
  .atp20-mcts .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp20-mcts .goldt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .atp20-mcts .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .atp20-mcts .okb { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-mcts .badb { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-mcts .node { fill: var(--bg); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-mcts .leaf { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.5; }
  .atp20-mcts .nodeg { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; }
  .atp20-mcts .noder { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .atp20-mcts .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.5; fill: none; }
  .atp20-mcts .arrf { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .atp20-mcts .ax { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.2; fill: none; }
  .atp20-mcts .grid { stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; stroke-dasharray: 3 4; fill: none; }
  .atp20-mcts .redl { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp20-mcts .goldl { stroke: var(--gold); stroke-width: 2; fill: none; }
  .atp20-mcts .mutl { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .atp20-mcts .redf { fill: var(--red); }
  .atp20-mcts .goldf { fill: var(--gold); }
  .atp20-mcts .mutf { fill: var(--text-faint); }
  .atp20-mcts .tick { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12px; }
  .atp20-mcts figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>